      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "It seems that the CPU should support avx2 instructions. My PC is I5-3570, which does not support avx2. I installed it several times and had the same problem. I created the corresponding docker image and installed it on my office's I5-10500, but GGGG was output in the same way. I recompiled bitnet.cpp and it worked fine. Note that lm studio will not work if avx2 is not supported either.",
